{
    "background_story": "Maya was a respected elder in her community, known for her wisdom and insight. She possessed a unique gift \u2013 the ability to sense impending danger or misfortune. Whenever Maya had a premonition, she would experience vivid dreams or unsettling feelings that would prompt her to warn others. Her warnings were often cryptic, but those who heeded them would avoid disaster. One fateful night, Maya had a monition about a devastating flood that would sweep through the village. She immediately alerted the villagers, urging them to evacuate. Though some were skeptical, many listened and moved to higher ground. When the floodwaters came, the village was spared, thanks to Maya's timely warning. From then on, her monitions were taken seriously, and she was revered as a guardian of the community.",
